        "name": "夜鷹純",
        "summary": "前男子花滑选手。摘得奥林匹克运动会的金牌后、便在风华正茂的20岁时选择了退役。",
        "relation": "配角",
        "actors": [
          {
            "images": {
              "small": "https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/38/47/15390_prsn_nhQl5.jpg",
              "grid": "https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/38/47/15390_prsn_nhQl5.jpg",
